      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast dual-phase lamellae are coarse.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Severe cold rolling followed by calibrated or optimized annealing is the proposed intervention.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermo-mechanical processing can preserve the cast lamellar character while producing an ultrafine duplex microstructure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cold rolling followed by annealing will generally transform coarse lamellar EHEAs into an ultrafine hierarchical duplex lamellar architecture.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed microstructure will have a high density of interphase boundaries.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cold rolling increases dislocation density.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cold rolling refines grains.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent annealing promotes selective phase decomposition and recovery.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting interphase boundaries impede dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hierarchical duplex architecture supports distributed strain accommodation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The combined boundary strengthening and strain accommodation mechanisms increase both strength and ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cold rolling and annealing can produce high strength while retaining appreciable elongation in AlCoCrFeNi2.1 EHEA.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed processing will simultaneously increase yield strength and ductility relative to the as-cast baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
